    "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">LAE101 · Chapter 4 · Session 12</span>\n<h2>Session 12 — Unit 3 - Intellectual property - Introduction and fundamental knowledge</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM syllabus 13384 · session plan</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">LAE101 · Chương 4 · Buổi 12</span>\n<h2>Buổi 12 — Unit 3 - Intellectual property - Introduction and fundamental knowledge</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: syllabus FLM 13384 · kế hoạch buổi</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Type</span><span class=\"v\">Offline</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">LO</span><span class=\"v\">CLO1, CLO2</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">ITU</span><span class=\"v\">I, T</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Slides in this lesson</span><span class=\"v\">none from FLM</span></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Hình thức</span><span class=\"v\">Offline</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">LO</span><span class=\"v\">CLO1, CLO2</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">ITU</span><span class=\"v\">I, T</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Slide trong bài</span><span class=\"v\">FLM không có</span></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>What this session covers (FLM, verbatim)</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Nội dung buổi học (FLM, nguyên văn)</h3></div>\n<p>Unit 3 - Intellectual property - Introduction and fundamental knowledge<br>Intellectual Property: The Need for Reform<br>Use AI tools to identify and analyze key reasons why current intellectual property (IP) law frameworks may be outdated or insufficient in the digital age.</p>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Materials to read</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Tài liệu cần đọc</h3></div>\n<p>Slides; Syllabus, and other materials suggested by Lecturer<br><br>Textbook: Intellectual Property Rights for Engineers - Chapter 1 - Introduction</p>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Student's tasks</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Nhiệm vụ sinh viên</h3></div>\n<p>Reading:<br>1. Textbook: Intellectual Property Rights for Engineers - Chapter 1 - Introduction<br><br>Working in group<br>Presenting, Reviewing, Discussing, working in group as stipulated in a standard Constructivism slot<br><br>AI Practice:<br>Students will use AI tools to identify and analyze key reasons why current intellectual property (IP) law frameworks may be outdated or insufficient in the digital age. They will explore global perspectives, emerging technologies, and societal shifts that challenge traditional IP models, The guidance as following:<br>1. Work individually or in pairs.<br>2. Use AI tools (e.g., Copilot, ChatGPT, Perplexity) to research arguments and expert opinions on why IP law needs reform.<br>3. Identify at least 3 key reasons for change. Suggested angles:<br>- Rise of generative AI and blurred authorship<br>- Global digital distribution vs. territorial IP rights<br>- Biotech and data ownership complexities<br>- Remix culture and user-generated content<br>- Access to knowledge vs. copyright monopolies<br>4. For each reason, students should:<br>- Describe the issue clearly<br>- Provide a real-world example or case<br>- Explain how current IP law fails to address it<br>- Suggest a possible direction for reform<br>- Prepare a short 5-minute presentation or infographic to share findings with the class.</p>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Detailed lecture and 🎬 video for this session: coming later. For now follow the slides, the materials and the tasks above.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Bài giảng chi tiết và 🎬 video cho buổi này: sẽ bổ sung sau. Trước mắt học theo slide, tài liệu và nhiệm vụ ở trên.</div></div>"
