    "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">LAE101 · Chapter 6 · Session 18</span>\n<h2>Session 18 — Unit 5 - Intellectual property - Copyright (Continue)</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM syllabus 13384 · session plan</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">LAE101 · Chương 6 · Buổi 18</span>\n<h2>Buổi 18 — Unit 5 - Intellectual property - Copyright (Continue)</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: syllabus FLM 13384 · kế hoạch buổi</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Type</span><span class=\"v\">Offline</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">LO</span><span class=\"v\">CLO1, CLO2, CLO3, CLO4</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">ITU</span><span class=\"v\">I, T</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Slides in this lesson</span><span class=\"v\">none from FLM</span></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Hình thức</span><span class=\"v\">Offline</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">LO</span><span class=\"v\">CLO1, CLO2, CLO3, CLO4</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">ITU</span><span class=\"v\">I, T</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Slide trong bài</span><span class=\"v\">FLM không có</span></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>What this session covers (FLM, verbatim)</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Nội dung buổi học (FLM, nguyên văn)</h3></div>\n<p>Unit 5 - Intellectual property - Copyright (Continue)<br>Exceptions to copyright infringement – fair dealing<br>Use AI tools to simulate a legal defense in response to a copyright infringement accusation.</p>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Materials to read</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Tài liệu cần đọc</h3></div>\n<p>Slides; Syllabus, and other materials suggested by Lecturer<br><br>Textbook:<br>1. Intellectual Property Rights for Engineers - Chapter 2 - Copyright<br>2. Social Media and the Law A Guidebook for Communication Students and Professionals - Chapter 4 - Intellectual property</p>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Student's tasks</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Nhiệm vụ sinh viên</h3></div>\n<p>Reading:<br>1. Intellectual Property Rights for Engineers - Chapter 2 - Copyright<br>2. Social Media and the Law A Guidebook for Communication Students and Professionals - Chapter 4 - Intellectual property<br><br>Textbook<br>Working in group<br>Presenting, Reviewing, Discussing, working in group as stipulated in a standard Constructivism slot.<br><br>AI Activity:<br>Students will use AI tools to simulate a legal defense in response to a copyright infringement accusation. They will explore relevant legal concepts, precedents, and exceptions (e.g., fair use) to build a reasoned argument.<br><br>1. Scenario Setup<br>Each student (or pair) receives a fictional situation in which they are accused of violating copyright. Example scenarios:<br>- Used copyrighted music in a YouTube video<br>- Quoted a large portion of a published article in a blog post<br>- Shared a meme based on a copyrighted image<br>- Trained a personal AI model on copyrighted content<br>2. Research with AI Tools<br>Students use AI (e.g., Copilot, ChatGPT) to:<br>- Understand the copyright issue involved<br>- Identify possible exceptions or defenses (e.g., fair use, parody, educational use)<br>- Find similar real-world cases or legal precedents<br>- Draft a short defense argument (max 300 words)<br>3. Present Defense Argument Each student presents their defense to the class or in small groups. The presentation should include:<br>- Summary of the accusation<br>- Legal basis for their defense<br>- Supporting examples or precedents<br>- A closing statement<br>4. Optional Role Play<br>Assign classmates to play the role of “copyright holder” or “judge” to challenge or evaluate the defense.</p>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Detailed lecture and 🎬 video for this session: coming later. For now follow the slides, the materials and the tasks above.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Bài giảng chi tiết và 🎬 video cho buổi này: sẽ bổ sung sau. Trước mắt học theo slide, tài liệu và nhiệm vụ ở trên.</div></div>"
