    "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">LAE101 · Chapter 12 · Session 37</span>\n<h2>Session 37 — Unit 11 - Commercial Speech in a Social Space</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM syllabus 13384 · session plan</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">LAE101 · Chương 12 · Buổi 37</span>\n<h2>Buổi 37 — Unit 11 - Commercial Speech in a Social Space</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: syllabus FLM 13384 · kế hoạch buổi</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Type</span><span class=\"v\">Offline</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">LO</span><span class=\"v\">CLO1, CLO2</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">ITU</span><span class=\"v\">I, T</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Slides in this lesson</span><span class=\"v\">none from FLM</span></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Hình thức</span><span class=\"v\">Offline</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">LO</span><span class=\"v\">CLO1, CLO2</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">ITU</span><span class=\"v\">I, T</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Slide trong bài</span><span class=\"v\">FLM không có</span></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>What this session covers (FLM, verbatim)</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Nội dung buổi học (FLM, nguyên văn)</h3></div>\n<p>Unit 11 - Commercial Speech in a Social Space<br>Truth in Advertising and Unfair Practices (Deceptive Endorsements)<br>Use AI tools to investigate real-world cases involving deceptive endorsements or unfair advertising practices.</p>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Materials to read</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Tài liệu cần đọc</h3></div>\n<p>Slides; Syllabus, and other materials suggested by Lecturer<br><br>Textbook: Social Media and the Law A Guidebook for Communication Students and Professionals - Chapter 5 - Commercial Speech in a Social Space</p>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Student's tasks</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Nhiệm vụ sinh viên</h3></div>\n<p>Reading: Textbook: Social Media and the Law A Guidebook for Communication Students and Professionals, Chapter 5 - Commercial Speech in a Social Space<br><br>Working in group<br>Presenting, Reviewing, Discussing, working in group as stipulated in a standard Constructivism slot<br><br>Students will use AI tools to investigate real-world cases involving deceptive endorsements or unfair advertising practices. They will evaluate how these practices affect consumer trust, violate legal standards, and challenge ethical norms in digital marketing.<br>1. Form small groups (2–3 students).<br>2. Use AI tools (e.g., Copilot, ChatGPT, Perplexity) to research one real-world case involving deceptive advertising or misleading endorsements. Suggested cases:<br>- Influencers failing to disclose paid partnerships<br>- Fake reviews or testimonials on e-commerce platforms<br>- Misleading health claims in product ads<br>- Brand manipulation through virtual influencers<br>3. Analyze the case using the following framework:<br>- What happened? (Brief summary of the situation)<br>- What laws or guidelines were violated? (e.g., FTC Endorsement Guides, Lanham Act)<br>- How did it affect consumer trust or public perception?<br>- What could have been done differently?<br>- How can AI help detect or prevent such practices?<br>4. Prepare a short presentation (5–7 minutes) or infographic that includes:<br>- Case summary<br>- Legal and ethical analysis<br>- AI’s role in identifying or mitigating deceptive practices<br>- Recommendations for advertisers and platforms</p>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Detailed lecture and 🎬 video for this session: coming later. For now follow the slides, the materials and the tasks above.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Bài giảng chi tiết và 🎬 video cho buổi này: sẽ bổ sung sau. Trước mắt học theo slide, tài liệu và nhiệm vụ ở trên.</div></div>"
